WEBVTT
X-TIMESTAMP-MAP=LOCAL:00:00:00.000,MPEGTS:0

1
00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:18.140
Video oyo ezali kolimbola ndenge ya kobongisa mwana mpe mama to mobateli liboso ya kosala ba tests ya réflex rouge fondal ezala na bana oyo babotami sika mpe na bana oyo bakómi mikóló.

2
00:00:19.860 --> 00:00:29.140
Esengeli kosimba mwana malamu kasi malamu, ezala na loketo, likoló ya lipeka, to, soki azali bebe, kolala na mokɔngɔ na bango.

3
00:00:29.140 --> 00:00:37.120
Ezali na ntina ete bámiyoka ete bazali na libateli. Bana mike bakoki kopema te mpe ekoki kosɛnga bákanga bango na nsinga.

4
00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:44.180
Kotalela mwa moke nsima ya koleisa ekoki kosalisa mpo bakopema mpe bakolala mwa mpɔngi.

5
00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:49.220
Bana oyo bakómi mikóló bakoki kofanda na kosakana na eloko ya kosakana mpo na mwa ntango moke.

6
00:00:49.620 --> 00:00:55.320
Lobá na mongongo ya boninga mpe meká kokita tii na nivo ya miso na bango.

7
00:00:55.320 --> 00:01:00.500
Limbolá nini okosala mpe zwá ndingisa liboso ya kobanda.

8
00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:10.440
Ya liboso, tuná mama to mobateli soki amoni likambo moko ya mabe na liso to na miso ya mwana na ye mpe ntango boni amoni mokakatano yango.

9
00:01:10.640 --> 00:01:15.120
Na nsima, talá elongi mpe miso ya mwana. Mituna mwa mituna.

10
00:01:15.680 --> 00:01:24.300
Emonani ete mwana azali na mpasi na miso moko to na miso nyonso mibale? Miso ezali kofungwama to ezali kokanga yango makasi?

11
00:01:24.300 --> 00:01:31.280
Ezali na mai to kobima na miso? Miso ezali na bonene ndenge moko? Ba paupières ya miso evimbi?

12
00:01:32.080 --> 00:01:38.580
Sikoyo, talelá ndenge mwana azali komona. Tambolá elongi na yo malɛmbɛmalɛmbɛ longwa na ngámbo na ngámbo, kotalaka miso na bango.

13
00:01:39.540 --> 00:01:47.970
Salá mwa masɛki ya nkuku. Mwana alandi ndenge elongi na yo ezali kotambola to ayanolaka soki ozali kosɛka na nkuku?

14
00:01:47.970 --> 00:01:53.990
Na likambo oyo mpe, omituna mwa mituna. Miso nyonso mibale etambolaka na bonsomi nyonso mpe elongo?

15
00:01:54.430 --> 00:02:01.110
Miso ezali semba to liso moko ezali kobaluka na kati to libanda? Miso ezali koningana?

16
00:02:03.300 --> 00:02:12.200
Okoki mpe kosalela miinda oyo ezali na ba cibles ya Arclight mpe ya bilili mpo na kozwa likebi mpe kotalela lolenge ya komona.

17
00:02:12.320 --> 00:02:20.660
Bokende na cible ngambo na ngambo, likolo mpe na se. Tala soki mwana azali kobongisa mpe kolanda cible.

18
00:02:21.960 --> 00:02:26.600
Bakoki kosimba mpe kolakisa na bosikisiki esika oyo bazali koluka?

19
00:02:27.360 --> 00:02:35.060
Mbala mingi, kaka liso moko nde ekoki komona malamu te. Yo to mama okoki kozipa liso moko, na nsima mosusu.

20
00:02:35.060 --> 00:02:43.320
Tambwisa cible mpe kokokanisa ndenge mwana azali komitambwisa na ntango ozali kosalela miso nyonso mibale, na nsima moko na moko.

21
00:02:43.520 --> 00:02:51.380
Soki mwana alingaka te kozipa liso moko, yango emonisi ete liso oyo ezipami te ezali komona malamu boye te.

22
00:02:51.560 --> 00:03:00.560
Soki okanisi ete okoki komona eloko moko ya mabe na liso ya libanda, tala malamu na kosaleláká nsuka ya loupe ya Arclight.

23
00:03:00.560 --> 00:03:12.150
Bofungola miinda mpe bomata pene na pene na 6 cm. Ekoki kosɛnga osalela mosapi na yo mpo na kofungola paupière ya miso na malɛmbɛ.

24
00:03:12.890 --> 00:03:24.070
Mituna mwa mituna. Eteni ya mpɛmbɛ ya liso ezali rose to motane? Pupille to cornée ezali gris to pembe?

25
00:03:24.070 --> 00:03:35.160
Mwana-kelasi azali rond? Okoki komona bibembe ya bapaya? Sikoyo ozali prêt ya kosala ba tests ya réflex.
